{
	"name": "Living Ember",
	"type": "object",
	"img": "icons/magic/fire/flame-burning-hand-orange.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>These miniature fire elementals are small enough to fit in the palm of the average humanoid. Like fire, their form is amorphous and ever-shifting, though tamed living embers can be taught to assume specific forms—typically those of small creatures such as mice, weasels, or songbirds. A living ember can provide sparks with which to start a larger flame, similar to a flint and steel. Adventurers attempting to handle a living ember with their bare hands must succeed a DC 12 Dexterity saving throw or take 1 point of fire damage.</p>",
